### Get client's KYC documents
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/clients/9/kyc-documents
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}


### Verify KYC document
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/kyc-documents/19/verify
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}